sequenceDiagram
  participant OS as Android sensors / FLP
  participant Main as MainActivity current owner
  participant Dir as Orientation HandlerThread
  participant Motion as UserMotionStateEstimator
  participant Coord as PositioningCoordinator
  participant Filter as PedestrianPositionEstimator
  participant Route as D03 RouteNavigator
  participant Other as Depth / RAW / field trace
  Note over OS,Other: D04 비동기 입력의 원 측정 시각·receipt·generation 분리
  Main->>OS: 현재 owner binding 등록
  OS-->>Dir: RV / magnetic 원 timestamp ns
  Dir->>Dir: route compass와 strict chest gate 각각 적용
  Dir-->>Main: history 및 latest snapshot
  OS-->>Main: GNSS Location 원 elapsed + receipt
  Main->>Main: binding·owner·generation 및 raw gate
  Main->>Motion: raw speed 근거 입력
  Main->>Coord: GNSS + 관측시각 GNSS risk
  Coord->>Filter: GNSS update
  alt history 범위 내 늦은 GNSS
    Filter->>Filter: rollback 후 correction 및 이후 motion replay
  else 현재 또는 새 GNSS
    Filter->>Filter: initialize / predict / soft weighted correction
  end
  Filter-->>Coord: measured-time estimate + replayed live estimate
  Coord-->>Main: position snapshot 및 disposition
  Main->>Route: fresh filtered 위치 + uncertainty + heading
  Main->>Other: measurement trace / 별도 live sensor trace
  OS-->>Main: HIGH single step 또는 MEDIUM batch
  Main->>Motion: 원 step 시각 근거
  Main->>Dir: step 이전 chest heading 조회
  Dir-->>Main: mounted strict heading 또는 null
  Main->>Coord: packet + speed/course history + profile
  Coord->>Filter: directional PDR 또는 covariance-only
  Filter-->>Main: 현재 estimate 및 quality
  Main->>Other: profile 기반 step length / 독립 typed motion
  OS-->>Main: 완전 IMU window
  Main->>Motion: quiet·rotation 근거
  Main->>Motion: 현재 통합 snapshot
  alt 독립 GNSS와 quiet stationary 근거 충족
    Main->>Coord: ZUPT 원 motion time
    Coord->>Filter: velocity-only correction / 필요 시 replay
  end
  Main->>Other: RAW 동의·ACTIVE일 때 aggregate only
  Main->>Main: stop 시 먼저 binding retire 및 generation 증가
  Main->>OS: remove / unregister
  OS-->>Main: late callback
  Main->>Main: owner·generation 불일치로 무시
